         "children": [
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "What Makes a Good Electrician Logo?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>A good <strong>electrical logo</strong> signals safety, expertise and dependability. Customers call an electrician when something is urgent or potentially dangerous, so the brand should feel competent and trustworthy rather than flashy.</p><p>Common symbols include lightning bolts, plugs, light bulbs, wires, circuits and sun icons for solar. Because lightning bolts are so common, the way the symbol is styled and combined with the name is what makes the logo distinctive.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
