          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Where Your Electrical Logo Will Appear",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>A electrical logo has to work in the places your customers actually see it. Logo Austin designs with these uses in mind:</p><div><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Placement</th><th scope=\"col\">Design Requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Service vans and trucks</strong></td><td>Large name and clear service type</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Uniforms and hats</strong></td><td>Simple icon that embroiders cleanly</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Yard signs at job sites</strong></td><td>High-contrast design readable from the street</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Quotes, permits and invoices</strong></td><td>Professional wordmark for commercial clients</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Google Business Profile</strong></td><td>Square icon for emergency-service searches</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
