          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ul><li>Style the lightning bolt distinctively; generic bolts look like clip art.</li><li>Make the service clear: residential, commercial, solar or lighting.</li><li>Use high contrast so the logo reads on white vans.</li><li>Keep a one-color version for decals and stamps.</li><li>Get vector files for vehicle graphics.</li></ul>",
